      "pinyin": "qián duō duō zài hé xiǎo liàng shuō huà tā gěi le xiǎo gǒu yí ge míng zi jiào kě lè",
      "english": "Qian Duoduo was talking with Little Liang. She gave the little dog a name called “Cola”."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
