    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "“可乐？可……乐……名字很可爱！”小亮笑了，说，“你想带她回家吗？”",
      "traditional": "“可樂？可……樂……名字很可愛！”小亮笑了，說，“你想帶她回家嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "kě lè kě lè míng zi hěn kě ài xiǎo liàng xiào le shuō nǐ xiǎng dài tā huí jiā ma",
      "english": "“Cola? Co … la … the name is really cute!” Little Liang smiled and said, “Do you want to take her home?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“我？我……我很忙，我……”钱多多看看可乐。",
      "traditional": "“我？我……我很忙，我……”錢多多看看可樂。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ wǒ wǒ hěn máng wǒ qián duō duō kàn kan kě lè",
      "english": "“Me? I … I’m really busy, I …” Qian Duoduo looked at Cola."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“你看，你喜欢可乐，可乐也很喜欢你！”小亮说。",
      "traditional": "“你看，你喜歡可樂，可樂也很喜歡你！”小亮說。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn nǐ xǐ huan kě lè kě lè yě hěn xǐ huan nǐ xiǎo liàng shuō",
      "english": "“You see, you really like Cola, and Cola also really likes you!” Little Liang said."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "是的，钱多多喜欢可乐，可乐也喜欢她。",
      "traditional": "是的，錢多多喜歡可樂，可樂也喜歡她。",
      "pinyin": "shì de qián duō duō xǐ huan kě lè kě lè yě xǐ huan tā",
      "english": "Yes, Qian Duoduo liked Cola, and Cola also liked her."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "但是钱多多的工作很忙，她下班很晚，她能照顾可乐吗？",
      "traditional": "但是錢多多的工作很忙，她下班很晚，她能照顧可樂嗎？",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì qián duō duō de gōng zuò hěn máng tā xià bān hěn wǎn tā néng zhào gù kě lè ma",
      "english": "But Qian Duoduo’s work was very busy, and she finished work very late. Would she be able to take care of Cola?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "弟弟喜欢狗吗？妈妈和谢叔叔呢？钱多多想了很多。",
      "traditional": "弟弟喜歡狗嗎？媽媽和謝叔叔呢？錢多多想了很多。",
      "pinyin": "dì di xǐ huan gǒu ma mā ma hé xiè shū shu ne qián duō duō xiǎng le hěn duō",
      "english": "Did her little brother like dogs? What about Mom and Uncle Xie? Qian Duoduo thought a lot about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "这两个星期，钱多多去了宠物店很多次。",
      "traditional": "這兩個星期，錢多多去了寵物店很多次。",
      "pinyin": "zhè liǎng ge xīng qī qián duō duō qù le chǒng wù diàn hěn duō cì",
      "english": "During these two weeks, Qian Duoduo went to the pet store many times."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "她给可乐吃的，她和可乐玩，她和可乐说话。",
      "traditional": "她給可樂吃的，她和可樂玩，她和可樂說話。",
      "pinyin": "tā gěi kě lè chī de tā hé kě lè wán tā hé kě lè shuō huà",
      "english": "She gave Cola things to eat, she played with Cola, and she talked with Cola."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "她想带可乐回家吗？她能照顾可乐吗？她没想好。",
      "traditional": "她想帶可樂回家嗎？她能照顧可樂嗎？她沒想好。",
      "pinyin": "tā xiǎng dài kě lè huí jiā ma tā néng zhào gù kě lè ma tā méi xiǎng hǎo",
      "english": "Did she want to take Cola home? Would she be able to take care of Cola? She couldn’t decide."
    }
  ],
