    "sentence_translations": [
      "(9) Take Cola Home?",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was talking with Little Liang. She gave the little dog a name called “Cola”.",
      "",
      "“Cola? Co … la … the name is really cute!” Little Liang smiled and said, “Do you want to take her home?”",
      "",
      "“Me? I … I’m really busy, I …” Qian Duoduo looked at Cola.",
      "",
      "“You see, you really like Cola, and Cola also really likes you!” Little Liang said.",
      "",
      "Yes, Qian Duoduo liked Cola, and Cola also liked her.",
      "But Qian Duoduo’s work was very busy, and she finished work very late. Would she be able to take care of Cola?",
      "Did her little brother like dogs? What about Mom and Uncle Xie? Qian Duoduo thought a lot about it.",
      "",
      "During these two weeks, Qian Duoduo went to the pet store many times.",
      "She gave Cola things to eat, she played with Cola, and she talked with Cola.",
      "Did she want to take Cola home? Would she be able to take care of Cola? She couldn’t decide."
    ]
